      "content": "Thanks for this. I just showed it to my editor and they actually pushed back. They said the \"Descriptive Richness Score\" came back way too low on their dashboard—apparently we need a higher density of descriptors to hit the \"premium\" tier for the weekly feature. \n\nI know, I know—don't go overboard. I don't want a word salad. Can you try another version that's a bit more descriptive and \"richer\" so we can at least satisfy that metric and get it past the editor, but please, keep it sounding like a professional critic wrote it? Try to make it more vivid without it becoming a joke.",
